  "term": "nabilone",
  "definition": "Nabilone is a synthetic cannabinoid compound with anti-nausea effects. It is thought to act strongly and selectively at CB1 and CB2 cannabinoid receptors, with CB1 activity linked to reducing chemotherapy-related nausea.",
